      "created_at": "2016-02-18T21:06:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So as a Super Sentai fan, and a Sentinels fan, I was pretty chuffed when I saw the varient for the new Idealist.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I just had to ask all of the questions though.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What does the Idealist think of Power Rangers?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Which is her favourite Super Sentai?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does she also like Kamen Rider, or is she a Sentai Purist?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What does she think of modern Sentai compared to the older ones?!</p>",
