      "raw": "[quote=\"Mezike\"]\n\nMy daughter, who is obsessed with the crazy insane dinosaur power rangers that is on TV at the moment, caught sight of the Idealist promo and said &quot;that&#39;s my new character&quot;. At least I&#39;ll finally get to play Unity again for a change.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nDino Charge is so Good! One of the Power Rangers in recent memory that has been better than the Sentai.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nWould have loved to ask in the Friday Art Stream, but I do not think it occured at a particularly friendly time for me yesterday.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI hope she is a continuing fan too. Her outfit looks like it took a lot of cues from Dairanger, which some elements, not including the suits, where worked into MMPR season 2. It is hard to imagine that was more than 20 years ago now!!!\n",
