      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-23T18:23:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was thinking about her mechanics last night and theorizing that her deck would revolve around putting out different, smaller&nbsp;mecha&nbsp;as hero targets and boosting their power. And if you were able to play all of the smaller mecha, you could combine them into an ultra-mecha.</p><p>But then I thought that would only be a possibility if Super Sentai Idealist was the base character card. Since Sentai Idealist is the promo, her deck probably won't have a lot to deal with Sentai stuff.</p>",
